["Passage 5: A changing neighborhood – for better or for worse?",`Recently, an international online retailer opened an enormous, brand-new office in our neighborhood. Until then, there hadn’t been any major companies or huge buildings like this in the area – just small family-owned businesses. So, obviously, there has been a lot of discussion about it lately.
